{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Light</b> — the meaning is <b>scattered</b>: if one sows little, he reaps much." "<b>and gladness for the upright of heart</b> — it is scattered. If so, <b>let them rejoice</b>: the meaning of all gladness is in the Name."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 97, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:30.970626029Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}